{"id":"wb-3-143","name":"栖霞寺舍利塔","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"栖霞寺舍利塔","text":"栖霞寺舍利塔，位于中华人民共和国江苏省南京市栖霞区栖霞街道的栖霞寺内，是一座八角五层的密檐式舍利塔，同时也是中国境内现存最大的舍利塔。该塔相传始建于隋朝年间，最初为木塔，塔毁后于五代南唐时期重建为石塔。该塔通高15米，由须弥座、塔身、密檐、塔刹几部分组成。1988年，栖霞寺舍利塔被列为全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%A0%96%E9%9C%9E%E5%AF%BA%E8%88%8D%E5%88%A9%E5%A1%94","revisionId":86785864,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86785864","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/25125e721be09c8be1d9a630.jpg","title":"栖霞寺舍利塔20230219_05.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E6%A0%96%E9%9C%9E%E5%AF%BA%E8%88%8D%E5%88%A9%E5%A1%9420230219_05.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/35/%E6%A0%96%E9%9C%9E%E5%AF%BA%E8%88%8D%E5%88%A9%E5%A1%9420230219_05.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"西安兵马俑","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​栖霞寺舍利塔","width":320,"height":427}}